*(kcs_locus_family
<div style="padding:5px">
  <h2>The kcs Gene Family</h2>

  <p>
    The kcs (3-ketoacyl-CoA synthase, aka "very long-chain fatty acid (VLCFA\) condensing enzymes"\) 
    gene names in Arabidopsis do not match equivalent kcs genes in maize.
    <br>
    Reference: <a href="https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0213620">Campbell et al., 2019</a>
    <br>
    Information provided by Basil Nikolau, Marna Yandeau-Nelsen, and the MaizeGDB team.
  </p>

  <br><br>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <th align="left">Arabidopsis gene name</th>
      <th align="left">MaizeGDB gene name</th>
      <th align="left">B73 v3 identifier
      <th align="left">B73 v4 identifier
      <th align="left">B73 v5 identifier
      <th align="left">Notes</th>
      <th align="left">MaizeGDB/UniProt information</th>
    </tr>
