        locus (KCS24\) and gene model in the B73v4 annotation. This is because they were 
        originally generated based on the B73v3 annotation. However, KCS3 and KCS5 are 
        different loci.	 
      </td>
      <td>
        For Arabidopsis KCS5, the correct B73v5 gene model is Zm00001eb399930, and the 
        correct B73v4 gene model is Zm00001d048059.
      </td>
    </tr>
